WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:02.130
Independence.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:06.410
With that declaration America was born.

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:12.510
Inspired by a belief in the God-given rights
of every human being, and in the good that

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:19.600
comes from exercising these rights well, the
founders of our great nation chose independence.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.760
As do we.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:25.120
Hillsdale College accepts no government funding.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:28.740
Because independence, makes possible the good
to which we aspire.

